=2 Walkthrough
* Open **Door: Prince Regent's Rm** in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} at (H-8) to start this quest.

>**You can continue as any job at this point.**
* Go to {z:Eldieme Necropolis} and kill {m:Dark Stalkers|Dark Stalker} until a {@i:Tavnazia Bell|1098} {i:Tavnazia Bell|Tavnazia Bell|1098} drops.
