* Locate the **???** at (G-8) on Map 1. This is just to west of the big fountain. Trade the {@i:Tavnazia Bell|1098} {i:Tavnazia Bell|Tavnazia Bell|1098} to the **???** to pop {m:Altedour I Tavnazia}. Be warned he is one of the strongest AF NMs out there. He will drop a {@i:Tavnazian Mask|13842} {i:Tavnazian Mask|Tavnazian Mask|13842}.
